    "body": "Hmm... I'm not so sure how to specify the storing of the value 😕 Like where I could keep it. I couldn't really find anything similar in the spec, only the same kind of sentences that the value should be returned until something has changed. Should I write something abstract that there should be some kind of cache for it? Could you maybe give me some pointers/examples?",
